1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:05,320
I've always wanted to talk
to a football match.

2
00:00:05,580 --> 00:00:08,780
To pause it, ask a question,

3
00:00:09,220 --> 00:00:12,760
and feel a little closer
to what's happening.

4
00:00:15,260 --> 00:00:18,000
That's why I'm building Matchmate.

5
00:00:18,820 --> 00:00:21,060
Here's Brentford against Chelsea.

6
00:00:21,520 --> 00:00:24,680
Choose a goal, see the sequence
on the pitch,

7
00:00:24,880 --> 00:00:27,300
and open a conversation about it.

8
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:31,940
The movement and statistics here
are generated illustrations,

9
00:00:32,580 --> 00:00:34,580
not measurements of the real match.

10
00:00:35,860 --> 00:00:37,620
Reported events are kept separate,

11
00:00:37,620 --> 00:00:40,680
so the evidence stays visible.

12
00:00:43,220 --> 00:00:44,980
I can pause,

13
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:48,540
select a player and explore
their details.

14
00:00:49,180 --> 00:00:51,020
Then I can ask about the replay

15
00:00:51,020 --> 00:00:54,340
or compare the teams in a chart,

16
00:00:54,440 --> 00:00:58,420
while keeping the match
and its context in view.

17
00:01:00,760 --> 00:01:04,300
I want it to feel comfortable
for different fans.

18
00:01:04,900 --> 00:01:10,400
Fan and Analyst offer different ways
into the same evidence,

19
00:01:10,840 --> 00:01:13,020
with language choices too.

20
00:01:15,180 --> 00:01:18,460
Beyond one match,
there's a season to explore.

21
00:01:18,460 --> 00:01:20,300
Move through dates,

22
00:01:21,100 --> 00:01:25,180
select a club and find its ground
on the illustrated map.

23
00:01:25,780 --> 00:01:28,000
I want those clubs and grounds

24
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:30,880
to feel like familiar companions.

25
00:01:33,480 --> 00:01:37,980
This demo replays prepared recordings.

26
00:01:38,800 --> 00:01:41,960
Live football integration
is still future work.

27
00:01:42,540 --> 00:01:46,140
My dream is to connect it
to the live game

28
00:01:46,140 --> 00:01:51,080
and one day let even the ball
and the pitch have a voice.

29
00:01:51,080 --> 00:01:52,450
Matchmate.

30
00:01:52,450 --> 00:01:55,740
A little closer to the match.
